# Required, not optional (Semprini spec 4.3).
#
# generated/ is written with LF line endings and compared byte for byte by
# `semprini check` (spec 5.5 rule 5, 6.1 check 7). Without this file, a clone on a
# machine with core.autocrlf=true — the Windows default — rewrites every generated file
# on checkout, and the determinism check then fails on content nobody touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Excel taxonomies are binary and must never be line-ending normalized or diffed as text.
*.xlsx binary
